{"path":"program/_Exit","title":"_Exit","titleHtml":"_Exit","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/program/_Exit","section":"program","kind":"page","summary":"Causes normal program termination to occur without completely cleaning the resources.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/program\"><code>&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev\">\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99 t-until-c11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> _Exit<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> exit_code <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-c11\">(until C11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c11 t-until-c23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">_Noreturn <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> _Exit<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> exit_code <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(since C11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-c23\">(until C23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span>noreturn<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> _Exit<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> exit_code <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Causes normal program termination to occur without completely cleaning the resources.\n</p><p>Functions passed to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/program/at_quick_exit\">at_quick_exit()</a></span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/program/atexit\">atexit()</a></span> are not called. Whether open streams with unwritten buffered data are flushed, open streams are closed, or temporary files are removed is implementation-defined.\n</p><p>If <code>exit_code</code> is <span class=\"t-lc\">0</span> or <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/program/EXIT_status\">EXIT_SUCCESS</a></span>, an implementation-defined status indicating successful termination is returned to the host environment. If <code>exit_code</code> is <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/program/EXIT_status\">EXIT_FAILURE</a></span>, an implementation-defined status, indicating <i>unsuccessful</i> termination, is returned. In other cases an implementation-defined status value is returned. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  exit_code\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  exit status of the program\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"coMULTI\">/* _Exit does not call functions registered with atexit. */</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/puts\"><span class=\"kw835\">puts</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"pushed first\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/puts\"><span class=\"kw835\">puts</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"pushed second\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Enter main()<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/program/atexit\"><span class=\"kw490\">atexit</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f1<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/program/atexit\"><span class=\"kw490\">atexit</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>f2<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fflush\"><span class=\"kw820\">fflush</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/io/std_streams\"><span class=\"kw886\">stdout</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>   <span class=\"coMULTI\">/* _Exit may not flush unwritten buffered data */</span>\n    _Exit<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Enter main()</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.22.4.5 The _Exit function (p: 256)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.22.4.5 The _Exit function (p: 352)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c99\">\n<ul><li> C99 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1999): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.20.4.4 The _Exit function (p: 316)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/program/abort\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>abort</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   causes abnormal program termination (without cleaning up) <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/program/exit\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>exit</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   causes normal program termination with cleaning up <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/_Exit\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>_Exit</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"program","title":"Program support utilities"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"_Exit","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations. Causes normal program termination to occur without completely cleaning the resources."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"exit_code"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"abort","note":"causes abnormal program termination (without cleaning up)"},{"label":"exit","note":"causes normal program termination with cleaning up"}]}]},"standards":["C99","C11","C23"],"wordCount":225,"codeBlockCount":2}
